  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 pounds banana peppers, cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "1 pound jalapeno peppers, cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "0.25 pound serrano peppers, cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "6 cups vinegar",
    "2 cups water",
    "1 medium onion, chopped",
    "3 cloves garlic, crushed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JPZ1R9Dh7AtOfsAo9sAPhzNcgQQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/35360-pickled-hot-peppers-ddmfs-ingredients-3x4-0757-b9e6a9af417048d486f8325ad1a77258.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35360/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inspect five pint-sized jars for cracks and rings for rust, discarding any defective ones. Immerse in simmering water until peppers are ready. Wash new, unused lids and rings in warm soapy water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place banana peppers, jalapeño peppers, and serrano peppers into a large pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LIpgDBQUsS-7FlpqrMiOfI63Vdo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/35360-pickled-hot-peppers-ddmfs-step-01-3x4-0761-b7fc6b5bd59b45b79769deae53e42912.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35360/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add vinegar, water, onion, and garlic. Bring to a boil over medium-high heat, then reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BmTfK_9qxaGjMwxk6bjnCQx1VjI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/35360-pickled-hot-peppers-ddmfs-step-02-3x4-0766-3e9018c65dc5413184c38012e2aa5a9f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35360/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladle peppers and liquid into hot, sterilized jars, filling to within 1/4 inch of the top. Run a clean knife or thin spatula around the insides of the jars to remove any air bubbles. Wipe rims with a moist paper towel to remove any residue. Top with lids and screw rings on tightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bekb3rGZZBwOOwEwhHg3hRThZ3g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/35360-pickled-hot-peppers-ddmfs-step-03-A-3x4-0776-9879687eab544a18885592e5ad83b94f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35360/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water. Bring to a boil and lower jars 2 inches apart into the boiling water using a holder. Pour in more boiling water to cover jars by at least 1 inch. Bring to a rolling boil, cover, and process for 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VVWjF0clW74FSn22yYF_YqqNH-k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/35360-pickled-hot-peppers-ddmfs-step-05-3x4-0781-2bbc14455f4c462191d55858651610e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35360/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the jars from the stockpot and let rest, several inches apart, for 12 to 24 hours. Press the center of each lid with a finger to ensure the lid does not move up or down. Remove the rings for storage and store in a cool, dark area.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Refrigerate after opening. Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DTT9jKp4mcNwsre9hHo2wXg3NrQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/35360-pickled-hot-peppers-ddmfs-hero-3x4-0805-4019d1a0a1504786b5a5f86615f96894.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35360/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
